<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>Form 5306-A</title>
    <style>
        @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
        .page {
            width: 794px; height: 1123px;
            padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
            overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
            position: relative;
            font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans";
        }
        .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
        table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 10px; }
        td { padding: 5px 0; }
        .header-title { font-size: 16pt; font-weight: bold; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 20px; }
        .section-header { font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
        .sub-header { font-size: 10pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 15px; margin-bottom: 5px; }
        .form-label { font-weight: normal; }
        .input-field { border-bottom: 1px solid #000; min-width: 150px; }
        .checkbox-group label { font-weight: normal; margin-right: 15px; }
        .line-item-table td:nth-child(1) { width: 70%; }
        .line-item-table td:nth-child(2) { width: 30%; text-align: right; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="page">
        <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; margin-bottom: 20px;">
            <div>
                <div style="font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold;">Form 5306-A</div>
                <div style="font-size: 10pt;">Application for Prototype Simplified Employee Pension (SEP) or Savings Incentive Match Plan for Employees of Small Employers (SIMPLE IRA Plan)</div>
                <div style="font-size: 10pt;">(Rev. November 2019)</div>
            </div>
            <div style="text-align: right;">
                <div style="font-size: 10pt;">OMB No. 15-045-0199</div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
            <div style="font-size: 10pt;">Department of the Treasury</div>
            <div style="font-size: 10pt;">Internal Revenue Service</div>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-bottom: 20px; font-size: 10pt;">
            (Under section 408(b) or (p) of the Internal Revenue Code)
            <br>
            Go to www.irs.gov/Forms/5306A for the latest information.
        </div>

        <div class="section-header">
            Part I For IRS Use Only
        </div>

        <table style="margin-top: 15px;">
            <tr>
                <td style="width: 50%;">
                    <div style="font-size: 10pt;">1 Enter amount of user fee submitted. See Specific Instructions. $ <span data-field="user_fee_amount">{{ user_fee_amount }}</span></div>
                </td>
                <td style="width: 50%; text-align: right;">
                    <div style="font-size: 10pt;">File folder number</div>
                </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td style="font-size: 10pt;">2 Approval requested for:</td>
                <td style="font-size: 10pt;"></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td style="font-size: 10pt;">( ) Type of plan—</td>
                <td style="font-size: 10pt;"></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td style="font-size: 10pt;">( ) Prototype simplified employee pension (SEP) under section 408(k)</td>
                <td style="font-size: 10pt;"></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td style="font-size: 10pt;">( ) Prototype savings incentive match plan for employees of small employers (SIMPLE IRA plan) under section 408(p)</td>
                <td style="font-size: 10pt;"></td>
            </tr>
        </table>

        <div class="section-header" style="margin-top: 30px;">
            Part II
        </div>

        <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
            <div style="font-size: 10pt;">3 If the SEP contains elective deferral provisions, check this box</div>
            <div style="margin-top: 5px;">
                <input type="checkbox" style="margin-right: 5px;">
            </div>
        </div>

        <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 20px;">
            <div style="width: 45%;">
                <div style="font-size: 10pt;">4a Name of applicant</div>
                <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; margin-top: 5px;">
                    <span data-field="applicant_name">{{ applicant_name }}</span>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div style="width: 45%; text-align: right;">
                <div style="font-size: 10pt;">4b Applicant's employer identification number</div>
                <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; margin-top: 5px;">
                    <span data-field="employer_id_number">{{ employer_id_number }}</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
            <div style="font-size: 10pt;">Number, street, and room or suite no. (if a P.O. box, see instructions)</div>
            <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; margin-top: 5px;">
                <span data-field="applicant_address_line_1">{{ applicant_address_line_1 }}</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
            <div style="font-size: 10pt;">City or town, state, and ZIP code</div>
            <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; margin-top: 5px;">
                <span data-field="applicant_city_state_zip">{{ applicant_city_state_zip }}</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 20px;">
            <div style="width: 45%;">
                <div style="font-size: 10pt;">5a Name of person to be contacted</div>
                <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; margin-top: 5px;">
                    <span data-field="contact_person_name">{{ contact_person_name }}</span>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div style="width: 45%; text-align: right;">
                <div style="font-size: 10pt;">5b Telephone number</div>
                <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; margin-top: 5px;">
                    <span data-field="contact_phone_number">{{ contact_phone_number }}</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
            <div style="font-size: 10pt;">5c Email address</div>
            <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; margin-top: 5px;">
                <span data-field="contact_email_address">{{ contact_email_address }}</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
            <div style="font-size: 10pt;">6 Type of submission (check one box): a Not a mass submitter b Mass submitter</div>
            <div style="margin-top: 5px; display: flex; gap: 30px;">
                <div style="display: flex; align-items: center;">
                    <input type="checkbox" style="margin-right: 5px;">
                    <label>c Identical adoption of a mass submitter</label>
                </div>
                <div style="display: flex; align-items: center;">
                    <input type="checkbox" style="margin-right: 5px;">
                    <label>d Minor modification of a mass submitter</label>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
            <div style="font-size: 10pt;">7a If box 6c or 6d is checked, enter the mass submitter's name:</div>
            <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; margin-top: 5px;">
                <span data-field="mass_submitter_name">{{ mass_submitter_name }}</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
            <div style="font-size: 10pt;">7b File folder number of the mass submitter's SEP or SIMPLE IRA plan on which this submission is based:</div>
            <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; margin-top: 5px;">
                <span data-field="mass_submitter_file_folder_number">{{ mass_submitter_file_folder_number }}</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
            <div style="font-size: 10pt;">8 Type of sponsoring organization:</div>
            <div style="margin-top: 5px; display: flex; gap: 30px;">
                <div style="display: flex; align-items: center;">
                    <input type="checkbox" style="margin-right: 5px;">
                    <label>a Insurance company</label>
                </div>
                <div style="display: flex; align-items: center;">
                    <input type="checkbox" style="margin-right: 5px;">
                    <label>e Regulated investment company</label>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div style="margin-top: 10px; display: flex; gap: 30px;">
                <div style="display: flex; align-items: center;">
                    <input type="checkbox" style="margin-right: 5px;">
                    <label>b Trade or professional organization</label>
                </div>
                <div style="display: flex; align-items: center;">
                    <input type="checkbox" style="margin-right: 5px;">
                    <label>f Federally insured credit union</label>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div style="margin-top: 10px; display: flex; align-items: center;">
                <input type="checkbox" style="margin-right: 5px;">
                <label>c Savings and loan association that qualifies as a bank</label>
            </div>
            <div style="margin-top: 10px; display: flex; align-items: center;">
                <input type="checkbox" style="margin-right: 5px;">
                <label>g Approved non-bank trustee (attach copy of approval letter)</label>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="section-header" style="margin-top: 30px;">
            Part III SEP Information
        </div>

        <div style="font-size: 10pt; margin-bottom: 20px;">
            Attach a copy of the SEP documents and indicate the article or section and the page number where the following provisions appear. If any item does not apply, write "N/A". Sample language, or a listing of required modifications (LRMs), is available at www.irs.gov/LRMs. Sponsors are encouraged to use LRMs language.
        </div>

        <table class="line-item-table" style="margin-top: 15px;">
            <thead>
                <tr>
                    <td style="width: 5%;"></td>
                    <td style="width: 40%;">Description</td>
                    <td style="width: 20%;">Plan Article or Section Reference</td>
                    <td style="width: 15%;">Plan Page Number</td>
                    <td style="width: 10%;">For IRS Use Only</td>
                </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
                {% for item in line_items %}
                <tr>
                    <td></td>
                    <td><span data-field="line_items[{{ loop.index0 }}].description">{{ item.description }}</span></td>
                    <td><span data-field="line_items[{{ loop.index0 }}].plan_reference">{{ item.plan_reference }}</span></td>
                    <td><span data-field="line_items[{{ loop.index0 }}].page_number">{{ item.page_number }}</span></td>
                    <td></td>
                </tr>
                {% endfor %}
            </tbody>
        </table>

        <div style="margin-top: 40px;">
            <div style="font-size: 10pt;">9a Does the SEP cover all employees who have attained age 21, performed service for the employer in 3 of the immediately preceding 5 years, and sealed the $600 in compensation from the employer for the year, other than employees who may be excluded under section 410(b)(A)(2) or (C)?</div>
            <div style="margin-top: 5px;">
                <input type="checkbox" style="margin-right: 5px;">
                <span data-field="line_items_9a_check">{{ line_items_9a_check }}</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
            <div style="font-size: 10pt;">9b Does the SEP provide that all eligible employees share in an allocation?</div>
            <div style="margin-top: 5px;">
                <input type="checkbox" style="margin-right: 5px;">
                <span data-field="line_items_9b_check">{{ line_items_9b_check }}</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
            <div style="font-size: 10pt;">9c Does the SEP contain a definite allocation formula that does not discriminate in favor of highly compensated employees?</div>
            <div style="margin-top: 5px;">
                <input type="checkbox" style="margin-right: 5px;">
                <span data-field="line_items_9c_check">{{ line_items_9c_check }}</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
            <div style="font-size: 10pt;">9d Does the SEP require that it be used only with pre-approved traditional IRAs?</div>
            <div style="margin-top: 5px;">
                <input type="checkbox" style="margin-right: 5px;">
                <span data-field="line_items_9d_check">{{ line_items_9d_check }}</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
            <div style="font-size: 10pt;">9e Does the SEP prohibit restrictions on withdrawals (other than restrictions permitted under section 408(d)(7)(A) in the case of a salary reduction SEP)?</div>
            <div style="margin-top: 5px;">
                <input type="checkbox" style="margin-right: 5px;">
                <span data-field="line_items_9e_check">{{ line_items_9e_check }}</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
            <div style="font-size: 10pt;">9f Does the SEP define "compensation" in a manner that satisfies one of the safe harbor definitions under section 414(a) and limit compensation under section 408(d)(C)?</div>
            <div style="margin-top: 5px;">
                <input type="checkbox" style="margin-right: 5px;">
                <span data-field="line_items_9f_check">{{ line_items_9f_check }}</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
            <div style="font-size: 10pt;">This is for amount for 2019 and 2020. The amount may be increased in future years for cost-of-living adjustments.</div>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-top: 50px;">
            <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start;">
                <div style="width: 45%;">
                    <div style="font-size: 10pt;">Sign Here</div>
                    <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; margin-top: 5px;">
                        <span data-field="signature_of_officer">{{ signature_of_officer }}</span>
                    </div>
                    <div style="font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 5px;">Signature of officer</div>
                </div>
                <div style="width: 45%; text-align: right;">
                    <div style="font-size: 10pt;">Date</div>
                    <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; margin-top: 5px;">
                        <span data-field="date_signed">{{ date_signed }}</span>
                    </div>
                    <div style="font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 5px;">Date</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-top: 50px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start;">
            <div style="width: 45%;">
                <div style="font-size: 10pt;">Title</div>
                <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; margin-top: 5px;">
                    <span data-field="title_of_officer">{{ title_of_officer }}</span>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div style="width: 45%; text-align: right;">
                <div style="font-size: 10pt;">Cat. No. 32621R</div>
                <div style="font-size: 10pt;">Form 5306-A (Rev. 11-2019)</div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="page">
        <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; margin-bottom: 20px;">
            <div>
                <div style="font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold;">Form 5306-A</div>
                <div style="font-size: 10pt;">Part III SIMPLE IRA Plan Information</div>
            </div>
            <div style="text-align: right;">
                <div style="font-size: 10pt;">Page 2</div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div style="font-size: 10pt; margin-bottom: 20px;">
            Attach a copy of the SIMPLE IRA plan documents and indicate the article or section and the page number where the following provisions appear. If any item does not apply, write "N/A". Sample language, or a listing of required modifications (LRMs), is available at www.irs.gov/LRMs. Sponsors are encouraged to use LRMs language.
        </div>

        <table class="line-item-table" style="margin-top: 15px;">
            <thead>
                <tr>
                    <td style="width: 5%;"></td>
                    <td style="width: 40%;">Description</td>
                    <td style="width: 20%;">Plan Article or Section Reference</td>
                    <td style="width: 15%;">Plan Page Number</td>
                    <td style="width: 10%;">For IRS Use Only</td>
                </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
                {% for item in line_items %}
                <tr>
                    <td></td>
                    <td><span data-field="line_items[{{ loop.index0 }}].description">{{ item.description }}</span></td>
                    <td><span data-field="line_items[{{ loop.index0 }}].plan_reference">{{ item.plan_reference }}</span></td>
                    <td><span data-field="line_items[{{ loop.index0 }}].page_number">{{ item.page_number }}</span></td>
                    <td></td>
                </tr>
                {% endfor %}
            </tbody>
        </table>

        <div style="margin-top: 40px;">
            <div style="font-size: 10pt;">10a Does the plan define the term "employer" to include all members of such groups or entities required to be aggregated with the employer?</div>
            <div style="margin-top: 5px;">
                <input type="checkbox" style="margin-right: 5px;">
                <span data-field="line_items_10a_check">{{ line_items_10a_check }}</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
            <div style="font-size: 10pt;">10b Does the plan limit adoption to employees that have 100 or fewer employees who earned $2,000 or more in compensation from the employer during the preceding calendar year?</div>
            <div style="margin-top: 5px;">
                <input type="checkbox" style="margin-right: 5px;">
                <span data-field="line_items_10b_check">{{ line_items_10b_check }}</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
            <div style="font-size: 10pt;">10c Does the plan limit adoption to employees that do not maintain another qualified plan to which contributions are made or benefits accrued?</div>
            <div style="margin-top: 5px;">
                <input type="checkbox" style="margin-right: 5px;">
                <span data-field="line_items_10c_check">{{ line_items_10c_check }}</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
            <div style="font-size: 10pt;">10d Does the plan define the term "employee" to include leased employees and employees described in section 401(c)(1)?</div>
            <div style="margin-top: 5px;">
                <input type="checkbox" style="margin-right: 5px;">
                <span data-field="line_items_10d_check">{{ line_items_10d_check }}</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
            <div style="font-size: 10pt;">10e Does the plan cover all employees except those who may be excluded under section 408(d)(A)?</div>
            <div style="margin-top: 5px;">
                <input type="checkbox" style="margin-right: 5px;">
                <span data-field="line_items_10e_check">{{ line_items_10e_check }}</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
            <div style="font-size: 10pt;">10f Does the plan provide that each eligible employee may make or modify a salary reduction agreement during the 60-day period immediately preceding the calendar year after receiving proper notice?</div>
            <div style="margin-top: 5px;">
                <input type="checkbox" style="margin-right: 5px;">
                <span data-field="line_items_10f_check">{{ line_items_10f_check }}</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
            <div style="font-size: 10pt;">10g Does the plan provide that salary reduction contributions may not exceed the statutory limits?</div>
            <div style="margin-top: 5px;">
                <input type="checkbox" style="margin-right: 5px;">
                <span data-field="line_items_10g_check">{{ line_items_10g_check }}</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
            <div style="font-size: 10pt;">10h Under the plan, is an eligible employee permitted to terminate a salary reduction agreement at any time?</div>
            <div style="margin-top: 5px;">
                <input type="checkbox" style="margin-right: 5px;">
                <span data-field="line_items_10h_check">{{ line_items_10h_check }}</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
            <div style="font-size: 10pt;">10i Does the plan provide that the employer will make matching contributions to each eligible employee's SIMPLE IRA equal to the employee's salary reduction contribution, up to a limit of 3% of the employee's compensation for the calendar year?</div>
            <div style="margin-top: 5px;">
                <input type="checkbox" style="margin-right: 5px;">
                <span data-field="line_items_10i_check">{{ line_items_10i_check }}</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
            <div style="font-size: 10pt;">10j Does the plan provide that the employer will make a 2% nonelective contribution to each eligible employee's SIMPLE IRA in lieu of matching contributions?</div>
            <div style="margin-top: 5px;">
                <input type="checkbox" style="margin-right: 5px;">
                <span data-field="line_items_10j_check">{{ line_items_10j_check }}</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
            <div style="font-size: 10pt;">10k Does the plan require that the employer will make salary reduction contributions to eligible SIMPLE IRA plans no later than 30 days after the month in which the amounts would otherwise have been payable to the employee in cash?</div>
            <div style="margin-top: 5px;">
                <input type="checkbox" style="margin-right: 5px;">
                <span data-field="line_items_10k_check">{{ line_items_10k_check }}</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
            <div style="font-size: 10pt;">10m Unless the employer has chosen, does the plan allow each eligible employee to select the financial institution for their SIMPLE IRA?</div>
            <div style="margin-top: 5px;">
                <input type="checkbox" style="margin-right: 5px;">
                <span data-field="line_items_10m_check">{{ line_items_10m_check }}</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
            <div style="font-size: 10pt;">10n If the employer has selected the financial institution, does the plan require the financial institution to meet the notification requirements of section 408(p)(7) and limitations according to section 408(p)(7)?</div>
            <div style="margin-top: 5px;">
                <input type="checkbox" style="margin-right: 5px;">
                <span data-field="line_items_10n_check">{{ line_items_10n_check }}</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
            <div style="font-size: 10pt;">10o Does the plan define "compensation" as described in section 408(p)(6)(A)?</div>
            <div style="margin-top: 5px;">
                <input type="checkbox" style="margin-right: 5px;">
                <span data-field="line_items_10o_check">{{ line_items_10o_check }}</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
            <div style="font-size: 10pt;">10p Does the plan require that it be used only with pre-approved SIMPLE IRAs?</div>
            <div style="margin-top: 5px;">
                <input type="checkbox" style="margin-right: 5px;">
                <span data-field="line_items_10p_check">{{ line_items_10p_check }}</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
            <div style="font-size: 10pt;">10q Does the plan prohibit restrictions on withdrawals?</div>
            <div style="margin-top: 5px;">
                <input type="checkbox" style="margin-right: 5px;">
                <span data-field="line_items_10q_check">{{ line_items_10q_check }}</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
            <div style="font-size: 10pt;">10r Does the plan provide that amendments will become effective only at the beginning of a calendar year and will conform to the content of the plan notice for the calendar year?</div>
            <div style="margin-top: 5px;">
                <input type="checkbox" style="margin-right: 5px;">
                <span data-field="line_items_10r_check">{{ line_items_10r_check }}</span>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>